<Positioned left="148" top="290"><Text fontSize="36" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">安全第一</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="148" top="354" width="580"><Text fontSize="23" color="#3D3C46" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">护目镜与防护罩先戴好；站在工具正面操作；勿穿拖鞋，长发束起；儿童须有成人陪同。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="504" width="714" height="216"><Container width="714" height="216" color="#EFE5CE" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
