<Positioned left="148" top="536"><Text fontSize="36" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">借出即登记</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="148" top="600" width="580"><Text fontSize="23" color="#3D3C46" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">工具用一次登记一次：谁、几号、几点取走、几点归还，钥匙当面交接，不转借他人。</Text></Positioned>
